    "body":  "Adds the Sentry connector (#820): an `oauth` catalog entry plus a skill.\n\n## Shape\n\nSentry\u0027s hosted MCP server (`https://mcp.sentry.dev/mcp`) advertises OAuth dynamic client registration and a discoverable revocation endpoint, so Core registers its own client and discovers the endpoints. Self-hosted Sentry is out of scope.\n\n## Least access\n\nRead asks for `org:read`; write adds `project:write`, `team:write`, `event:write` and `alerts:write`. No member-management or org-admin scopes.\n\n## How it was tested\n\n`just check`, `just typecheck` and the loader and registry test suites pass. Added the shipped-entry assertions to `test_loader.py` and the registry adapter set.\n",
